      "cooked": "<p>A team up against AZ</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-235-writers-room-justice-comics-583\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-235-writers-room-justice-comics-583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-235-writers-room-justice-comics-583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #235 - Writers' Room: Justice Comics #583</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Choo-chooooose Sentinel Comics this holiday season!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:15:38 Happy Holiday times, everyone! We've got a story full of Christmas cheer... and trains heist! Multiple trains; one heist. You'll see! If you're on , join us this...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"a5Ca4ArA6m774ZXKVQ6370Gnpi1\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/46b83e4c0c8c72caa3edb95a834741cabd2174e9_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 548 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
