    {
      "id": 250074,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-12-20T16:53:47.142Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I did catch one of those livestreams, thanks to the Discord, that was cool. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> Missed the SI one though!</p>\n<p>Love that description of Brazilian jiujitsu. This is some great banter. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Legit feel like I’m going to spend the rest of the day watching jiujitsu videos.</p>\n<p>Okay, I feel good for knowing those were some characters on the cover was from Tachyon’s one incap, even if I didn’t remember their names. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Boy, that guy just really loves trains.</p>\n<p>“Die Hard on a train with Absolute Zero.” What a thing they have discovered themselves into. XD</p>\n<p>That Ray Manta, can’t rely on him for anything.</p>\n<p>I’m so glad they went funny with this one, that was great. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>I love when they’re talking about the cover and one of them says they definitely don’t want something that is clearly already on the cover.</p>\n<p>Chips made out of chicken? Oh no, I hope I never find these, I’ll have to try them. D: I got some that were supposed to taste like wild game once, and they were <em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vc89GDbxf6M\">nasty</a></em>.</p>",
