      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I did catch one of those livestreams, thanks to the Discord, that was cool. :) Missed the SI one though!\n\nLove that description of Brazilian jiujitsu. This is some great banter. :D Legit feel like I'm going to spend the rest of the day watching jiujitsu videos.\n\nOkay, I feel good for knowing those were some characters on the cover was from Tachyon's one incap, even if I didn't remember their names. :)\n\nBoy, that guy just really loves trains.\n\n\"Die Hard on a train with Absolute Zero.\" What a thing they have discovered themselves into. XD\n\nThat Ray Manta, can't rely on him for anything.\n\nI'm so glad they went funny with this one, that was great. :D\n\nI love when they're talking about the cover and one of them says they definitely don't want something that is clearly already on the cover.\n\nChips made out of chicken? Oh no, I hope I never find these, I'll have to try them. D: I got some that were supposed to taste like wild game once, and they were *[nasty](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vc89GDbxf6M)*.",
