      "created_at": "2026-01-19T18:34:28.964Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think they were heavily pulling from On The Rails, which also includes Cold Shoulder and Current but omits Thermos.</p>\n<p>PS who knew Yeti was cut and hunkish/himboish?  I assumed he was all fur.</p>\n<p>Biomancer is prohibited from making a real human in rather the same way that Absolute Zero is prohibited from having a suit that never breaks.</p>\n<p>I like how Christopher is like “do they taste like waffles or just maple syrup”, and Adam’s answer is “they taste like waffles but I don’t even need waffles if I just have maple syrup”.  Lol, well done guy.</p>",
